{"title":"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Supplement\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Supplement</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangle</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fdcd080c79859b6133f52c74ffa9f9b22e8f99c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\sin A + 4 \\cos B = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"160\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8d51d64fa1044dc63361bf68bb6a124af2bc0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\sin B + 3 \\cos A = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"160\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4056d41f42aa8a00adca0ff5d1209b6bb0e92d6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> in degrees is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3badf72b81a98fb3d31762cab36b914564e8775.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }30 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }60 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ }90 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }120 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ }150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"405\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square the given equations and add (simplifying with the Pythagorean identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a958fb1f7b5b87ef62ed4a2205643ef36cb3df4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2 x + \\cos^2 x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"146\" height=\"19\" />):\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/e/97e6d7a5c53ec8c9350d7efc88cfd971bbcafa0f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 9\\sin^2 A + 16\\cos^2 B + 24 \\sin A \\cos B &amp; = 36 \\\\ + 9\\cos^2 A + 16\\sin^2 B + 24 \\sin B \\cos A &amp; = 1 \\\\ \\Longrightarrow 25 + 24(\\sin A \\cos B + \\sin B \\cos A ) &amp; = 37 \\end{align*}\" width=\"338\" height=\"73\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/a/14a007145d4180dd527be779ead905197d14864b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 12 = \\sin A \\cos B + \\sin B \\cos A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"227\" height=\"37\" />. This is the sine addition identity, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/9/0a9418d59af60a43bfe1be128020aeeee81db207.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 12 = \\sin (A + B) = \\sin (180 - C) = \\sin C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"312\" height=\"37\" />. Thus either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df734ea60ab3a8221dd0622877712f65745f8139.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 30^{\\circ}, 150^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />. \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/f/52f93942e8808afdba9e2dacec416f073a6ac8da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/7/657b613178dd87c82be55eb2863e5ba969b15fa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + B = 30 \\Longrightarrow A,B &lt; 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"210\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e3f81890f6149bde1ddb5f67d488caa56cfc297.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin A &lt; \\frac 12, \\cos A &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"37\" />. The first equation implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c9616f62e7fc9fd4bbc08f4401c66586ae3e9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 = 3 \\sin A + 4\\cos B &lt; 3\\left(\\frac 12\\right) + 4(1) = 5.5 &lt; 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"371\" height=\"43\" />, which is a contradiction; thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/c/00cbb71c8fe2f52834d6d896644636574db05473.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 30 \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Supplement\">Supplement</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Supplement\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding the two given equations gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/e/a0e704432d05c811518583bef1bb42ebbb408627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(\\sin A + \\cos A)+4(\\sin B + \\cos B) =7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"310\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/03074e8850a15011316fb28bdd0d428067c6b2db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are both acute. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are both acute, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/c/fccc9c8934a3bc7140c5d6f9064d0a49f3340a79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin A + \\cos A &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/4/a34498ef09f70eb5d54bfd74832c02049cdc7b59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin B + \\cos B&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/1/a9173982e0164176493eb87e907f11f814fbcee9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(\\sin A + \\cos A)+4(\\sin B + \\cos B) &gt;7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"310\" height=\"20\" />. This contradicts the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/e/a0e704432d05c811518583bef1bb42ebbb408627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(\\sin A + \\cos A)+4(\\sin B + \\cos B) =7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"310\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/0/c404dff152b4eef840b55badb700e393d25fffef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B \\neq 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdcac3953b70e76a2b356d21a8cbedc5ffaae977.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B = 150^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40d6b8f16bb4ff7a476c83cae35ba9c3fcfe5b1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME\" title=\"1999 AHSME\">1999 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1999\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"cen